message: "Cite the technical report below for the design and methods. Record the report commit and chapter; for software or measurements, also identify the source revision, target and workload used."
type: software
title: "open-cake-ir: Reusable optimization mechanisms across hardware"
authors:
  - family-names: "Qin"
    given-names: "Haiyan"
    email: "haiyanq@buaa.edu.cn"
    affiliation: "Beihang University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qhy991/open-cake-ir"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Compiler-centered research framework for reusing conditional optimization
  mechanisms across hardware. Agents author explicit execution plans; reviewed
  discoveries from structured and native exploration may become transformations,
  diagnostics or lowering capabilities. Target implementations require independent
  correctness and performance validation. Controlled studies test search cost,
  coverage and the incremental effects of materials and executable tools. Cite the
  source commit, exact target, workload and measurement contract for each result.
keywords:
  - GPU kernels
  - compilers
  - intermediate representation
  - agent systems
  - CUDA
  - Metal
  - HIP

